{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01741","headline":"杂曲歌辞 东飞伯劳歌 · 张柬之","name":"杂曲歌辞 东飞伯劳歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青田白鹤丹山凤，婺女姮娥两相送。\n谁家绝世绮帐前，艳粉芳脂映宝钿。\n窈窕玉堂褰翠幕，参差绣户悬珠箔。\n绝世三五爱红妆，冶袖长裾兰麝香。\n春去花枝俄易改，可叹年光不相待。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张柬之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}